#: .\appIurrelan\templates\acabado.html:7
msgid ""
"Garantizamos la integridad estructural y superficial de sus componentes "
"mediante procesos certificados."
msgstr ""
"We guarantee the structural and surface integrity of your components through "
"certified processes."

