#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:183
msgid "El Valor del"
msgstr "The Value of"

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:183
msgid "Rebarbado Perfecto"
msgstr "Perfect Deburring"

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:185
msgid ""
"El rebarbado no es solo un paso final; es la garantía de calidad, seguridad "
"y funcionalidad de cada pieza metálica. En Iurrelan eliminamos cantos "
"vivos..."
msgstr ""
"Deburring is not just a final step; it is the guarantee of quality, safety, "
"and functionality of every metal part. At Iurrelan, we eliminate sharp "
"edges..."

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:187
msgid "Mayor seguridad en la manipulación posterior"
msgstr "Greater safety in subsequent handling"

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:188
msgid "Adherencia perfecta para pintura y tratamientos"
msgstr "Perfect adhesion for paint and treatments"

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:189
msgid "Estética profesional y acabados uniformes"
msgstr "Professional aesthetics and uniform finishes"

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:203
msgid "Rebabado Manual"
msgstr "Manual Deburring"

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:207
msgid "REBARBADO <br> MEDIANTE<br>AMOLADORAS"
msgstr "DEBURRING <br> USING<br>GRINDERS"

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:208
msgid ""
"Intervención directa mediante herramientas portátiles para zonas complejas. "
"Nuestros técnicos aplican discos de desbaste y láminas abrasivas para "
"eliminar cordones de soldadura, suavizar aristas y corregir defectos "
"superficiales con precisión geométrica."
msgstr ""
"Direct intervention using portable tools for complex areas. Our technicians "
"apply grinding discs and abrasive flap discs to remove welding seams, smooth "
"edges, and correct surface defects with geometric precision."

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:211
msgid "ACABADO FINO"
msgstr "FINE FINISH"

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:212
msgid "FLEXIBILIDAD"
msgstr "FLEXIBILITY"

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:213
msgid "ACCESO DIFÍCIL"
msgstr "DIFFICULT ACCESS"

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:219
msgid "Rebabado Suspendido"
msgstr "Suspended Deburring"

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:223
msgid "REBARBADO <br> MEDIANTE<br> MÁQUINAS <br>SUSPENDIDAS"
msgstr "DEBURRING <br> USING<br> SUSPENDED <br>MACHINES"

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:224
msgid ""
"Sistemas pendulares de alta potencia para el procesamiento de grandes "
"superficies. La suspensión ingrávida permite al operario aplicar presiones "
"de trabajo elevadas y constantes, logrando tasas de remoción de material "
"superiores en piezas de gran tonelaje."
msgstr ""
"High-power pendular systems for processing large surfaces. Weightless "
"suspension allows the operator to apply high and constant working pressures, "
"achieving superior material removal rates on heavy parts."

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:227
msgid "ALTA POTENCIA"
msgstr "HIGH POWER"

#: .\appIurrelan\templates\rebarbado.html:228
msgid "RENDIMIENTO"
